      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I plan to use this struct in coreboot. But no, there\u0027s no naming conflict.\n\nAs this file is ec_commands.h, I\u0027d expect all APIs/structs to have the \"ec_\" prefix to a have better namespace. However, as there are already exceptions in this file, using `cbi_` seems fine.",
